{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想回去，却说不清是舍不得曾经被当作自己人的日子，还是害怕孤单到愿意重新忍受那些委屈。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"纠结、孤单、心慌、害怕\",\n      \"missed\": \"小字段落中声音由沉重到短暂稳定、再度漂散的过程，以及重新遇见过去那个不知所措的自己、最初的问题仍无答案等内容，需要逐句读。右上三条提示也不容易完整抓到。下方中央一串明亮金色节点和横线只能看出抽象的音乐动画。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想回去，却分不清自己怀念的是曾经的归属感，还是害怕离开之后的孤独。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"矛盾、失落、孤独、心慌\",\n      \"missed\": \"小字段落里声音变化与人物过去经历之间的联系，以及向前的步伐还没聚起来、问题仍无答案等内容，要仔细读才能理解。右上三条提示容易被忽略。下方大面积留黑，右侧金色连线和圆点是抽象音乐动画，不能直接读出人物处境。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他对是否回到过去仍然犹豫，既舍不得曾经的归属感，又害怕孤独，想到这个问题便不敢继续面对。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"犹豫、怀念、孤独、心慌\",\n      \"missed\": \"小字段落中重新审视过去的自己、短暂稳定感消失、最初的问题重新浮现等层次，需要逐句阅读。右上三条提示也需要专门看才能读全。下方中央亮点与右侧节点连线仍然只是抽象的音乐动态。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"大标题和结尾之间的因果关系很清楚：回去的两难让他心慌。但大标题一条长句同时装入两种回去动机，需要读完才能完全理解；中间小字的音乐变化描写和下方抽象音符动画，又不容易一眼对应到人物的处境和感受。整体人物故事与情绪能够串起来，但画面这一块更多是独立的音乐视觉表现，缺少直接的情绪指向。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8a2c0353-e4e0-4ae8-a943-9b8fc53b8284", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004200675617Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:43:30.124391+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "97aa3f348fc368cc0df59add7a0faa16a715808358d2199cef02196d0727b503", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004200675617Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "03b1da250238e11f2cd0d1fb1547a21e431e37ea45f5da471c77f1db3c6f77d7"}}}
